              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tha̱a̱ŋ nath ri̱t kä cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn tin kɔ̱kiɛn ɛ lo̱k ɛn ɣöö ba min cɛ lar ŋäth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ, cukɛ gua̱c kärɔ̱, kä mëë däk piny, cu Puɔl ruac kɛl lat i̱, “Te Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ kɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ kɛ lärɛ gua̱ndɔɔŋnikun kɛ thok go̱kä ni I-ca-yaa i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
